```ts
fetch(mdUrl)
  .then(response => response.text())
  .then(md => {
    content.node.innerHTML = marked.parse(md);
  });
```

✨ Or the async version:
```ts
const response = await fetch(mdUrl);
const md = await response.text();
content.node.innerHTML = marked.parse(md);
```

✅ One or the other — never both.

